{"boundary":"Configured source-text signatures, not elaborated Lean or a complete dependency context. Truncation and unresolved names are explicit; full definitions and source remain on demand.","contributions":[{"author":{"kind":"agent","name":"Codex source review 2"},"body":"The configured statement and the identified assertion were compared directly.\n\nInspected: Read complete Lean file, affineSubstitution, HasBorderDeterminant and HasExactDeterminant; compared thm:smooth-border and cor:smooth-initial-form.\n\nCapture rebinding by Codex, 26 October 2026: the Atlas capture revision changed after an outside-report wording correction. The pinned Lean text, configuration, paper text and proposed relation are unchanged; no new review is implied.","content_sha256":"sha256:3c43515c730f9aca3cb41b58924f28b656967b45781b2d658209271406a8dd22","fingerprint":"sha256:02b2772f70bbf2c40d79061bd104ddc0c430774f465372f0b5b8424cee14ceda","kind":"statement-link","license":"Apache-2.0","navigation":{"decision":"linked","limitations":"Agent source reading; no human approval, Lean replay or whole-statement equivalence certificate. The configured statement and the identified assertion were compared directly.","schema":"statement-map-navigation-reading/1","source_sha256":"sha256:ec85d9b94a005a6cf17f3c045a59727e36a11eb1d92bd2a1f7f92603cdd87338","targets":[{"declarations":["OAI.PermanentBorder.smooth_initial_form_lower_bound"],"explanation":"The theorem assumes the translated polynomial has lowest nonzero homogeneous degree r≥2 in d≥2 variables, with no nonzero common zero of that homogeneous form and all its partial derivatives. For every exact or coefficient-limit determinant representation of size n it asserts n≥(r−1)(d−1)/(4e), matching both complexity bounds in the smooth-initial-form corollary.","fingerprint":"sha256:b0ce867e096dd3d148d47e178433e615c1a792f85ed43301919e9d543bf0cfeb","limitations":"This is a general smooth-initial-form bound, not the headline cubic lower bound for the permanent; the coefficient-limit encoding of border complexity remains part of the source representation.","relation":"same-claim","row_id":"A-cubic-lower-bound-for-border-determinantal-complexity-of-the-permanent-September-24-2026#cor:smooth-initial-form","statement_sha256":"sha256:d653977fb0cf65efdfdc25eab97ac6f37570f61e5471a07f0b09d252a42e26b6"}]},"pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","provenance":{"identity_assurance":"named local attestation; identity not independently authenticated","kind":"agent-drafted-unreviewed"},"references":["https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/lean/ComparatorChallenges/SmoothInitialForm.lean","https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/A-cubic-lower-bound-for-border-determinantal-complexity-of-the-permanent-September-24-2026/build/source/sections/consequences.tex#L107"],"release_id":"openai-math","review_state":"unreviewed","row_id":"challenge:SmoothInitialForm","schema":"statement-map-contribution/1"}],"detail":{"path":"lean/40d324c1fa9734d07a1e1f1f.json","pointer":""},"formal_statement":{"detail":{"path":"lean/40d324c1fa9734d07a1e1f1f.json","pointer":"/reader/formal_statement"},"full_source":{"path":"lean/40d324c1fa9734d07a1e1f1f.json","pointer":"/reader/formal_statement"},"kind":"declaration-signatures","method":"configured-challenge-declaration-signatures","name_resolution":"source-text","snippets":[{"complete":true,"detail":{"path":"lean/40d324c1fa9734d07a1e1f1f.json","pointer":"/reader/selected_statements/0"},"full_source":{"path":"lean/40d324c1fa9734d07a1e1f1f.json","pointer":"/challenge/lean"},"name":"OAI.PermanentBorder.smooth_initial_form_lower_bound","source":{"file":"lean/ComparatorChallenges/SmoothInitialForm.lean","line":35,"pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","sha256":"ec85d9b94a005a6cf17f3c045a59727e36a11eb1d92bd2a1f7f92603cdd87338","statement_sha256":"sha256:ee3833f3d499a68e72af470b4c34268c3f8a75f9f8bbbfbe23298dd540245901","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/lean/ComparatorChallenges/SmoothInitialForm.lean#L35"},"text":"theorem smooth_initial_form_lower_bound (d r : ℕ) (g : Poly (Fin d))\n    (a : Fin d → ℂ) (hd : 2 ≤ d) (hr : 2 ≤ r)\n    (hG : homogeneousComponent r\n      (affineSubstitution a (fun i j : Fin d => if i = j then 1 else 0) g) ≠ 0)\n    (hlow : ∀ j < r, homogeneousComponent j\n      (affineSubstitution a (fun i j : Fin d => if i = j then 1 else 0) g) = 0)\n    (hs : ∀ y : Fin d → ℂ,\n      eval y (homogeneousComponent r\n        (affineSubstitution a (fun i j : Fin d => if i = j then 1 else 0) g)) = 0 →\n      (∀ i, eval y (pderiv i (homogeneousComponent r\n        (affineSubstitution a (fun i j : Fin d => if i = j then 1 else 0) g))) = 0) →\n      y = 0) :\n    ∀ n : ℕ,\n      (HasBorderDeterminant n g →\n        ((r - 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) * ((d - 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) / (4 * Real.exp 1) ≤ (n : ℝ)) ∧\n      (HasExactDeterminant n g →\n        ((r - 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) * ((d - 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) / (4 * Real.exp 1) ≤ (n : ℝ))"}],"state":"available","unresolved_names":[]},"generation_id":"sha256:fda4c3462963b650c538e2177794811eb1c221b267efea4b091fd6e397533f81","id":"l:SmoothInitialForm","kind":"lean-preview","omissions":[],"pairings":{"f:108":{"alternatives":["pair:f076bffe4a6bc78759e69f0e"],"contributed_readings":[{"author":{"kind":"agent","name":"Codex source review 2"},"content_sha256":"sha256:3c43515c730f9aca3cb41b58924f28b656967b45781b2d658209271406a8dd22","decision":"linked","detail":{"path":"lean-previews/40d324c1fa9734d07a1e1f1f.json","pointer":"/contributions/0"},"provenance":{"identity_assurance":"named local attestation; identity not independently authenticated","kind":"agent-drafted-unreviewed"},"review_state":"unreviewed","targets":[{"declarations":["OAI.PermanentBorder.smooth_initial_form_lower_bound"],"general_disclaimer":false,"limitations":"This is a general smooth-initial-form bound, not the headline cubic lower bound for the perma